  "Posted 'Fett with BR' dested Boba Fett With Blaster Rifle; 'DV with LS' Darth Vader With Lightsaber; 'Iggy with RG' IG-88 With Riot Gun; 'Jabba (se)' the Special Edition Jabba; 'Djas Phur' Djas Puhr; 'ORS' Outer Rim Scout; 'Bus' Bossk In Hound's Tooth; 'Jabbas SC' Jabba's Space Cruiser; 'MJ LS' Mara Jade's Lightsaber.",
  "Monnok and Sniper are the A New Hope Interrupts (the Reflections II combos came later); 'Elis Helrod' dested Elis Helrot; Come Here You Big Coward is the Special Edition Effect (no Defensive Shields in 2000).",
  "The strategy says to start Any Methods Necessary, Fett, Fett in Slave I and the Dungeon; Any Methods Necessary is a normal Interrupt, so starting.interrupt is left empty."
